brick.camp — Source Code License
================================

The MIT license below covers the source code of brick.camp: the Hugo templates
under layouts/, this project's own JavaScript and stylesheets under assets/, the
icons under static/icons/ and the build configuration.

It does not cover the dictionary content — entry texts, LDraw models, the
renders built from them and the entry metadata — which is CC BY 4.0; see
LICENSE-CONTENT.

It does not cover third-party material either. Several bundled libraries live
under assets/ next to code that this license does cover, and most images in
content/ belong to someone else. THIRD-PARTY.md lists all of it.

